      "knowledge_id": "unirank-method-infnet",
      "decision": "used",
      "rationale": "Pinned benchmark aggregation/broadcast source inspected as nearest work. Its task-aware multi-view aggregation motivates the controlled read of retained g0 structured state; this is external design provenance, not local effectiveness evidence. Previous declared use produced no supported match-prior gain; revise that explanation rather than erase the null result. Original paper detail remains unaudited.",
      "transformed_mechanism": "Reuse existing four task queries and tied Q/K/V to read final g0 field/relation tokens at both query-refinement stages; retain one-way exact masks, no global-to-local broadcast, unchanged raw-event terminal pool. Uniform active addressing controls the proposed query dependence.",
